[8545]="70044512\n1\tDeliver the torn skins to a collection box\030Collect torn skins (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire torn skins.\n",
[8546]="70071B2A\n1\tFind the mine at Erakúndo\030Find the mine at Gebarakór\030Find the mine at the Arch of Adazâr\030Find the mine at Lâkindar\tKufâro has asked you to visit the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assess their condition. Erakúndo and Gebarakór are near each other in southern An Shêru. Adazâr is in the far western part of the region, and Lâkindar is in the south-west corner.\n2\tTalk to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have visited the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assessed their condition. You should return to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[8547]="7002D57B\n1\tCollect barbed claws and drop them in a collection box (total: 10)\tCollection boxes for this task can be found in the major hubs of Moria. You should bring the trophies you gathered to a collection box.\n",
