[8559]="70001814\n1\tDefeat Dourhands at Thurûm (total: 8)\tDourhand miners can be found at Thûrum, north of Othrikar. You should defeat miners at Thurûm.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the dangerous Dourhand miners at Thurûm, reducing the grave threat to Othrikar.\n",
[8560]="7000AF33\n1\tEscort Tyrfing into the Isendeep\tTyrfing is at the small encampment of the Free Peoples outside the western entrance to the Isendeep. Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn directed you to safely escort Tyrfing and his miners into the mine so they can return to mining the ore needed for the battle in the Ettenmoors.\n",
[8561]="7005A68B\n1\tMine crystals (total: 12)\tCrystals can be found throughout Gundabad. You should mine crystals for Bráthi.\n2\tReturn to Bráthi with the crystals that you have mined\tBráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset. You should return to Bráthi with the crystals that you have mined.\n",
[8562]="70059353\n1\tTalk to Addy Rushtuft\tAddy Rushtuft can be found at Trader's Wharf. You should talk to Addy Rushtuft.\n2\tDestroy mining supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy cut stones (total: 10)\tCut stones and mining supplies can be found at the West-delf and East-delf in the Wildwood. You should destroy the cut stones and mining supplies found in the West-delf and East-delf.\n3\tTalk to Addy Rushtuft near the West-delf in the Wildwood\tAddy Rushtuft wishes to meet up near the West-delf in the Wildwood to mine the hills. You should talk to Addy Rushtuft in the Wildwood.\n4\tDefeat the Writhenset foreman\030Defeat the Writhenset overseer\030Repair support beams in Writhenset (total: 12)\tThe entrance to Writhenset can be found in the West-delf and East-delf. You should enter Writhenset, defeat the mining leaders, and repair support beams.\n5\tFind the source of the cave-in\tThe cave-in seems to have come near the West-delf entrance in Writhenset. You should find the source of the cave-in.\n6\tFind the source of the cave-in\tThe cave-in seems to have come near the West-delf entrance in Writhenset. You should find the source of the cave-in.\n7\tRemove rubble in Writhenset (total: 6)\tRubble can be found in Writhenset. You should clear the rubble to see what was in this section of the mine.\n8\tTalk to Enid Nettlesting\tRubble can be found in Writhenset. You should clear the rubble to see what was in this section of the mine.\n9\tTalk to Enid Nettlesting\tEnid Nettlesting can be found at Trader's Wharf. You should talk to Enid Nettlesting.\n",
[8563]="70046895\n1\tCollect ore (total: 8)\tVeins of ore can be found around the base of Mount Mindolluin. You should mine the base of the mountain for ore.\n2\tPlace the ore in the forge\tThe forge is located in Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor. You should bring the ore to the forge.\n3\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[8564]="7002EF7B\n1\tDefeat goblins at Thrug-unur (total: 10)\tGoblins can be found at Thrug-unur, north-east of Éomer's Vengeance in the Entwash Vale. You should defeat as many goblins as you can to further aid the cause of Thane Béortnoth and the survivors of Thornhope.\n",
[8565]="70000074\n1\tMeet Baillindiel to receive further Minstrel training\tBaillindiel is at Celondim, the Elf-harbour in Ered Luin. You have been told to speak with Baillindiel, a talented minstrel who may desire to speak with you.\n2\tTalk to Baillindiel\tBaillindiel is at Celondim, the Elf-harbour in Ered Luin. You have been told to speak with Baillindiel, a talented minstrel who may desire to speak with you.\n",
[8566]="700174E3\n1\tTalk to Pada\tPada has travelled to Moria to lend his aid to the dwarf-expedition that has gone to excavate the mines. Pada is a very advanced Minstrel of great renown, and you should call on him to learn what he has to teach as you bring your skills to a peak.\n2\tTalk to Pada\tPada has travelled to Moria to lend his aid to the dwarf-expedition that has gone to excavate the mines. Pada is a very advanced Minstrel of great renown, and you should call on him to learn what he has to teach as you bring your skills to a peak.\n",
[8567]="70020DBE\n1\tCollect boar-droppings (total: 10)\tBoar-droppings can be found throughout the Gloomglens. Iago Glennudh has asked you to gather boar-droppings for use as fertilizer.\n2\tTalk to Iago Glennudh at Maur Tulhau\tIago Glennudh is at Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith. You should bring the boar-droppings you collected to Iago Glennudh.\n",
[8568]="70020DC2\n1\tCollect boar-droppings (total: 10)\030Collect marigolds (total: 10)\tBoar-droppings and marigolds can be found throughout the Gloomglens. Iago Glennudh has asked you to go out and find more boar-droppings and marigolds.\n2\tTalk to Iago Glennudh at Maur Tulhau\tIago Glennudh is at Maur Tulhau in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith. You should bring the droppings and flowers you collected back to Iago Glennudh.\n",
[8569]="70041C6B\n1\tClear Corsair-filth from the river Gilrain (total: 8)\030Defeat Corsairs polluting the Gilrain (total: 8)\tCorsair-filth can be found along the shores of the Gilrain to the north of Linhir. Erchar has asked you to clear the Corsairs' filth from the Gilrain before it can pollute more of Linhir's water.\n2\tTalk to Erchar in Linhir\tErchar can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have cleared the river of filth and should now return to Erchar.\n",
[8570]="7001ACB7\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Malledhrim.\n",
[8571]="7001ACB6\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Malledhrim.\n",
[8572]="7001ACBD\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Malledhrim.\n",
[8573]="7001ACB4\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred to the Malledhrim.\n",
[8574]="70016020\n1\tSpeak with Sylfa in the Rotting Cellar\tSylfa is in the Rotting Cellar, on the eastern edge of the Water-works. Sylfa will be pleased to hear the mirror has been adjusted, and light shines throughout the Water-works, at least for today.\n",
[8575]="700266DA\n1\tCollect mirrors from tomb-robbers (total: 8)\tMirrors can be found on tomb-robbers at Tham Sarch, north-east of the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Nethrandir asked you to recover mirrors from the tomb-robbers in Tham Sarch.\n2\tBring the mirrors to Nethrandir\tNethrandir is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Nethrandir will want to examine the mirrors you collected.\n",
[8576]="7001909B\n1\tTalk to Wandering Elf\tSaelthaliel's Elf-friends can probably be found wandering throughout the maze. The maze is in the Horse-fields of Bree, north of Bree-town. You should speak to each Elf and encourage them to move a little faster towards getting to the exit of the maze.\n2\tTalk to Saelthaliel outside the maze in the Horse-fields\tSaelthaliel is standing just outside the entrance to the hedge maze, waiting for word of her friends. You should tell Saelthaliel of all that passed inside the maze.\n",
})
